---
title: Complaint State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open : Retailer reports shortage/damage after confirmed receipt
    Open --> UnderReview : Operator starts processing (separates disputed amount)
    UnderReview --> Approved : Admin approves adjustment (affected batch net price)
    UnderReview --> Rejected : Admin rejects — restore per record
    Approved --> Resolved : adjustment applied (receivable adjusted / refund raised)
    Rejected --> Resolved : closed with no financial change
    Open --> Resolved : direct resolve
    Resolved --> [*]
